    "summary": "Create a hosted payment page that accepts card and Mobile Money.",
    "text": "export default function HostedCheckout() {\n return (\n <>\n \n Hosted Checkout is the fastest way to accept card and Mobile Money payments. You create a session,\n we return a secure payment page URL, and you redirect the customer to it. No card data ever touches\n your servers, so PCI scope stays with us.\n\n The API key must have write access. Read-only keys receive \n 403 insufficient_scope .\n\n Endpoint \n\n The legacy path / /collect/card is an alias for this endpoint. Raw card\n (PAN) charges are no longer accepted.\n\n POST / /payout/momo and POST / /payout/bank now\n return 501 provider_unsupported . Payouts are initiated manually from \n Payouts in the dashboard.\n\n Request \n\n true,\n CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER => true,\n CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER => [\n \"Authorization: Bearer wr_test_...\",\n \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n ],\n CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS => json_encode([\n \"amount\" => 170.00,\n \"customer_email\" => \"customer@example.com\",\n \"channel\" => \"ANY\",\n \"desc\" => \"Order 1042\",\n ]),\n]);\n$session = json_decode(curl_exec($ch), true);\nheader(\"Location: \" . $session[\"checkout_url\"]); ,\n },\n ]}\n />\n\n Response \n\n Never fulfil an order on the redirect alone. Confirm with \n \n GET /v1/transactions/ \n \n and check resolved_status === \"approved\" . The 15% platform fee is applied at settlement.\n\n )\n}"
